[00:00.00]Avicii - The Nights (DJ NOXMU版)
[00:34.20]Hey once upon a younger year
[00:36.25]When all our shadows disappeared
[00:38.05]The animals inside came out to play
[00:41.73]Hey went face to face with all our fears
[00:43.88]Learned our lessons through the tears
[00:45.73]Made memories we knew would never fade
[00:48.94]One day my father he told me
[00:51.24]Son don't let it slip away
[00:53.09]He took me in his arms I heard him say
[00:56.85]When you get older
[00:58.05]Your wild heart will live for younger days
[01:00.90]Think of me if ever you're afraid
[01:04.40]He said one day you'll leave this world behind
[01:07.70]So live a life you will remember
[01:11.90]My father told me when I was just a child
[01:15.70]These are the nights that never die
[01:19.25]My father told me
